#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Umicom Framework
# File: cmake/UmicomCrossPlatformDistributionPlatform.cmake
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Extend the canonical distribution target with cross-platform runtime, bundle,
#   package, installer, update, rollback, release and deployment control state.
#
# ARCHITECTURE:
#   Existing Umicom::distribution and Umicom::delivery remain authoritative.
#   This platform adds reusable cross-platform packaging/distribution policy and
#   does not move installer/update logic into individual applications.
#
# Created by: Sammy Hegab
# Organisation: Umicom Foundation
# Licence: MIT
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
